    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Noam,<div><br></div><div>Just submitted my availabilities. Doing it directly through the e-mail is convenient :) </div><div><br></div><div>As a follow up to your suggestion after my ESA talk, it would be fun to get together and chat sometime about what might be useful packages to develop for IPMs. In addition to the work I presented at ESA on demographic stochasticity, I have also been doing a lot of work with environmental stochasticity in IPMs and have developed a few new sensitivity formulas for these types of models as well. </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers, Sebastian </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
