     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Sep 22, 2014 at 11:02 AM, Sebastian Schreiber <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">sschr...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Noam,<div><br></div><div>Just submitted my availabilities. Doing it directly through the e-mail is convenient :) </div><div><br></div><div>As a follow up to your suggestion after my ESA talk, it would be fun to get together and chat sometime about what might be useful packages to develop for IPMs. In addition to the work I presented at ESA on demographic stochasticity, I have also been doing a lot of work with environmental stochasticity in IPMs and have developed a few new sensitivity formulas for these types of models as well. </div><div><br></div><div>Cheers, Sebastian </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Sep 22, 2014 at 10:58 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">noam...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"display:inline;width:576px\"><div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>Hi all,</p><p>It&#39;s time to vote for our fall D-RUG meeting time, which will start next week.  Please fill out the form below to have your say.</p><p></p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1lNF6AUyytkBdnCR7tb61EMZ5FkRBKEn05PZeiMmOgus/viewform?c=0&amp;w=1&amp;usp=mail_form_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1lNF6AUyytkBdnCR7tb61EMZ5FkRBKEn05PZeiMmOgus/viewform?c%3D0%26w%3D1%26usp%3Dmail_form_link&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468687386000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AE